{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765506,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"SILK ROUTE \u2013 The Business Quiz","festival_id":null,"organization_id":936080,"web_url":"www.instagram.com\/vivaan_iift\/?hl=en","start_date":"2026-10-05T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-29T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"quizzes","public_url":"quiz\/silk-route-the-business-quiz-indian-institute-of-foreign-trade-iift-kolkata-1765506","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>Threads That Trade: People. Places. Possibilities.:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Quizardry, IIFT Kolkata presents SILK ROUTE &ndash; The Business Quiz, the flagship quiz event of VIVAAN 12.0 &ndash; IIFT Kolkata's Annual Business Summit.<\/li>\n<li>The Silk Route was never just about moving goods. It connected people, ideas, cultures, businesses and markets across the world.<\/li>\n<li>This quiz takes that idea forward.<\/li>\n<li>From business and brands to trade, economics, geopolitics and the stories behind the world's biggest markets, SILK ROUTE is a test of how well you can connect the dots.<\/li>\n<li>So, whether you're a quiz enthusiast, a business nerd, a curious mind, or simply someone who enjoys a good challenge &mdash; come find out how far your knowledge can take you.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Same Routes. New Realities. Bigger Questions.:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>What to Expect:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2 exciting rounds<\/strong> &ndash; Prelims &amp; Finals<\/li>\n<li><strong>Solo &amp; Pair<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Top 6 teams<\/strong> from the Prelims advance to the Finals<\/li>\n<li>Questions spanning <strong>Business &bull; Trade &bull; Economics &bull; Brands &bull; Markets &bull; Geopolitics &bull; Global Affairs<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>A live quiz conducted by renowned quizmaster <strong>Souvik Basu<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>And, of course, <strong>cash prizes for the top three teams!<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Cash Prizes:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1st Place &mdash; \u20b98,000<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>2nd Place &mdash; \u20b94,000<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>3rd Place &mdash; \u20b93,000<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Event Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Date:<\/strong> 31 October 2026<\/li>\n<li><strong>Reporting Time:<\/strong> 4:45 PM<\/li>\n<li><strong>Quiz Starts:<\/strong> 5:15 PM<\/li>\n<li><strong>Venue:<\/strong> IIFT Kolkata Auditorium<\/li>\n<li><strong>Team Size:<\/strong> Solo \/ Pair<\/li>\n<li><strong>Participation:<\/strong> Open for All<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Who Can Participate?:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Anyone who enjoys:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Business and markets<\/li>\n<li>Trade and economics<\/li>\n<li>Brands and companies<\/li>\n<li>Geopolitics and current affairs<\/li>\n<li>History and the stories behind commerce<\/li>\n<li>Or simply <strong>good questions<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You don't need to be a management student or a professional quizzer.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Just bring your curiosity.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Why Silk Route?:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Because the most interesting business stories rarely exist in isolation.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>A product connects to a market.<\/li>\n<li>A market connects to a country.<\/li>\n<li>A country connects to policy.<\/li>\n<li>Policy connects to geopolitics.<\/li>\n<li>And somewhere along the way, <strong>everything connects.<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>SILK ROUTE is about finding those connections.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants can compete <strong>solo, in pairs, or in teams of three<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>The quiz will consist of <strong>two rounds: Prelims and Finals<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>The <strong>top 6 teams<\/strong> from the Prelims will qualify for the Finals.<\/li>\n<li>Participants are expected to report by <strong>4:45 PM<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>The quiz will begin at <strong>5:15 PM sharp<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must follow the instructions provided by the quizmaster and organising team.<\/li>\n<li>Any form of malpractice or unfair means may lead to disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>The decision of the quizmaster and organising committee will be <strong>final and binding<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>Further round-specific instructions will be announced at the venue.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>For Further Queries Please Contact :<br \/><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Satish Sharma -<\/span><br \/>satishs_kd27@iift.edu<br \/>9123127617<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Ishu -&nbsp;<\/span><br \/>ishu_kd28@iift.edu<br \/>6203175974<\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":25915843,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:44:04+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T12:24:36+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"oxGUiAd","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":97,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-04 19:38:05","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/uploadedManual-6ac25d1c4dcac_silk_route_the_business_quiz.jpg","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/uploa